OL,3,AChancellor refuses to rule out tax
OL,4,Ahikes in October Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has refused to
OL,7,Frule out tax increases in next month's
OL,8,FBudget after acknowledging government
OL,9,Fborrowing costs are at "historic
OL,10,Fhighs".
OL,12,FIn an interview with the BBC, Healey
OL,13,Fsaid he wants people to feel "confident
OL,14,Fabout Britain and our future".
OL,16,FBut he said "times are tough", with
OL,17,FJaguar Land Rover (JLR) on Monday
OL,18,Fannouncing 4,000 planned job cuts,
OL,19,Fmostly in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
